Text Notes 500 7200 0    60    ~ 0
NTC divider behavior: open thermistor -> ADC near 3.3 V; short -> ADC near 0 V. Firmware treats both as faults and uses the hottest valid reading.
Text Notes 500 7600 0    60    ~ 0
Initial fixed resistor 4.7k improves resolution over roughly 40-120 C. Calibrate thresholds against measured MOSFET case/junction temperature.
$EndSCHEMATC
